Description: 4k intro by Faemiyah, released in 2019
 Región de Magallanes is a 4k intro by Faemiyah (Juippi, Trilkk, Warma),
 released at Assembly 2019, where it ranked 4th in the PC 4k intro
 competition.
 .
 This package contains the standard (non size-optimized) build of the
 intro. Press F to toggle fullscreen and Esc to quit.

Package: regiondemagallanes-by-faemiyah-data
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Data files for regiondemagallanes-by-faemiyah
 Región de Magallanes is a 4k intro by Faemiyah, released at Assembly 2019.
 .
 This package contains the shaders and the precalculated soundtrack
 (compressed as FLAC) used by regiondemagallanes-by-faemiyah.
